message: "If you use this multi-scale observatory, reverse-proxy metrology architecture, verification suite, or white paper, please cite it as below."
title: "OMEGA 4-Tier Multi-Scale Observatory (v6.7.0): A Loopback Reverse-Proxy Telemetry Hub with a Render-Only Observer Convention and Automated Tests Across Eight Local Artificial-Life Endpoints"
